", "content": "习题三 …… 135"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第4章 信息论基础 …… 139"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4.1 通信系统的数学模型 …… 140"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4.2 信息的度量 …… 141"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4.3 联合熵与条件熵 …… 150"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4.4 互信息与平均互信息 …… 156"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4.5 离散信源 …… 161"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "4.6 信息论在密码学中的应用 …… 176"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "习题四 …… 181"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第5章 计算复杂性基础 …… 185"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.1 时空复杂性与算法分析 …… 186"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.2 确定图灵机与P类问题 …… 191"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.3 RAM模型 …… 197"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.4 非确定性图灵机与NP类问题 …… 200"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.5 NP完全性 …… 204"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.6 若干典型的NP完全问题 …… 207"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5.7 计算复杂性理论在密码学中的应用 …… 212"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "习题五 …… 218"}]}]}]}, {"page_idx": 13, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.665, 0.139, 0.791, 0.169], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第1章"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.573, 0.203, 0.835, 0.252], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "数论基础"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.1, 0.341, 0.844, 0.499], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "数论研究整数环中整数最基本性质,整除理论、同余理论和不定方程求解构成数论的基本内容。随着信息技术的飞速发展,数论所涉及的知识在信息领域特别是信息安全领域具有广泛的应用,公钥密码标准 RSA 算法是基于大整数分解困难性而设计的,通信系统中广泛使用的 Diffie-Hellmen 协议与整数的同余和原根密切相关。掌握数论的基本知识,对于从事信息安全理论与应用研究具有重要作用。"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 14, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.085, 0.058, 0.105, 0.071], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.406, 0.056, 0.567, 0.072], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.055, 0.113, 0.285, 0.136], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1.1 整数的整除"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.096, 0.168, 0.453, 0.186], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "全体整数的集合通常用 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 来表示, 即"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.343, 0.196, 0.631, 0.213], "content": "\\mathbb {Z} = \\{0, \\pm 1, \\pm 2, \\pm 3, \\dots \\}"}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.051, 0.223, 0.92, 0.309], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "在整数集合 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中,两个整数可以进行加、减、乘三种运算,并且运算后的结果仍为整数。但两个整数进行除法运算后所得的结果未必为整数,比如4除以2所得结果为2,它是一个整数,而4除以3所得结果为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\frac{4}{3}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ,它不是整数。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.051, 0.331, 0.919, 0.377], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 1.1 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a, b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是任意两个整数, "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b \\neq 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 如果存在整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a = bc"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则称 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 整除 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 记做 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b \\mid a"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 否则称 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 不整除 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 记做 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b \\nmid a"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.051, 0.393, 0.919, 0.439], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "如果有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b \\mid a"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，称 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的因数，"}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的倍数。显然 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\pm 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是任何整数的因数，所有的非零整数均为 0 的因数。由整除的定义，易知如下性质成立:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.098, 0.448, 0.4, 0.466], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(1) 如果  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c \\mid b, b \\mid a"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，则  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c \\mid a;"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.097, 0.476, 0.711, 0.494], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(2) 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c \\mid b, c \\mid a"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 则对任意 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m, n \\in \\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 均有 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "c \\mid (ma + nb)"}, {"type": "text", "content": ";"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.097, 0.502, 0.501, 0.521], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(3) 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "b \\mid a"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a \\neq 0"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|b| \\leqslant |a|"}, {"type": "text", "content": "；"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bb