)^{2}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " ，从而根据整除的性质(3)，得到"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.349, 0.767, 0.622, 0.784], "content": "6 \\mid (k + 1) (k + 2) (2 k + 3)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.054, 0.794, 0.634, 0.812], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "由归纳法原理， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "6\\mid n(n + 1)(2n + 1)"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 对任意正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 成立。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.096, 0.822, 0.907, 0.841], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例1.2 如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m, n, r, q \\in \\mathbb{Z}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，并且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(m - p) \\mid (mn + pq)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，证明 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(m - p) \\mid (mq + np)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.097, 0.857, 0.221, 0.875], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "证明 由于"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.074, 0.886, 0.895, 0.903], "content": "m q + n p = m q - p q + p q + m n - m n + n p = q (m - p) + (m n + p q) - n (m - p)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.055, 0.912, 0.457, 0.93], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "上式右边三项都是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m - p"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的倍数，从而有"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 15, "blocks": [{"type": "header", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.435, 0.065, 0.596, 0.08], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "第1章 数论基础"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.898, 0.067, 0.916, 0.079], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "3"}]}, {"type": "equation", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.407, 0.1, 0.624, 0.117], "content": "(m - p) \\mid (m q + n p)"}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.082, 0.126, 0.946, 0.172], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定理 1.1(带余除法) 设 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "a, b \\in \\m