n_inline", "content": "0 \\equiv -1 \\bmod p"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 矛盾!"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.054, 0.601, 0.924, 0.73], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "(必要性)当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n = 2,3"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时， "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(n - 1)! \\equiv -1 \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 显然成立。当 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n > 3"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 时，令 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "S = \\{2,3,\\dots, n - 2\\}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "|S| = n - 3"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。对任意 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\in S"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，由于 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 为素数，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(x, n) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，于是存在唯一 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y \\in S"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，使得 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "xy \\equiv 1 \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，并且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\neq y"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。记 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "y = x^{-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，如果 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x' \\in S"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，并且 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x \\neq x'"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，则 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x'^{-1} \\neq x^{-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，从而 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "S"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 中 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "n - 3"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 数个两两互逆，于是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(n - 2)! \\equiv 1 \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，故 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(n - 1)! \\equiv -1 \\bmod n"}, {"type": "text", "content": "。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.055, 0.739, 0.924, 0.895], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "例 1.8 的结果称为 Wilson 定理, 利用 Wilson 定理可以进行整数的素性测试, 并且该方法是确定性算法。但如果分析一下该算法中乘除法的次数, 就会发现当 n 比较大时, 计算上是不可行的。事实上, 利用 Wilson 定理进行素性测试, 需做 n-2 次乘法和 1 次除法。当 n 为大整数时, 比如 n 为 100 位的十进制整数, 即使使用当今最快的计算机来测试, 也需要很多年的时间来完成。也就是说从计算上而言, 用 Wilson 定理判定 n 的素性是不可行的。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.101, 0.909, 0.92, 0.928], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "定义 1.9 设  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\overline{0}, \\overline{1}, \\cdots, \\overline{m-1}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  是模 m 的全部剩余类, 如果  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "(r, m) = 1"}, {"type": "text", "content": " , 则称  "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "\\bar{r}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "  为模 m 互"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 32, "blocks": [{"type": "page_number", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.086, 0.056, 0.113, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "20"}]}, {"type": "header", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.407, 0.054, 0.567, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "信息安全数学基础"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.052, 0.089, 0.92, 0.134], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "mod "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m_i"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 对每个 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "i"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 成立，故 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(x_0) \\equiv 0 \\bmod m"}, {"type": "text", "content": "，即 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "x_0"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 是 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "f(x) \\equiv 0 \\bmod m"}, {"type": "text", "content": " 的一个解。由证明过程易知定理后一命题成立。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.052, 0.143, 0.921, 0.19], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "对于给定的正整数 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m"}, {"type": "text", "content": ", 设其标准分解式为 "}, {"type": "equation_inline", "content": "m = p_{1}^{a_{1}} p_{2}^{a_{2}} \\cdots p_{s}^{a_{s}}"